+# Audit categories
+
+Categories, not patterns. A new pattern lands under an existing category. "Covered by" names the
+control in this project; the last column says whether a test asserts it.
+
+| Category | Covered by | Enforced mechanically? |
+|---|---|---|
+| Authentication and sessions | `isLoggedInMiddleware` in `app/routes/session.js`; server-side session store | partly: the e2e login specs |
+| Authorization per route | `isAdminUserMiddleware` in `app/routes/session.js`, wired per route in `app/routes/index.js` | yes for `/benefits` (`benefits_access_guard_spec.js`); no for the rest |
+| Input validation | per-handler checks, no shared validator | no |
+| Database query construction | MongoDB driver calls in `app/data/*-dao.js` | no |
+| Outbound requests | `needle` in `app/routes/research.js` | no |
